{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39691","headline":"经安州感故郑郎中二首 一 · 黄滔","name":"经安州感故郑郎中二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云梦江头见故城，人间四十载垂名。\n马蹄践处东风急，鸡舌销时北阙惊。\n岳客出来寻古剑，野猨相聚呌孤茔。\n腾身飞上凤凰阁，惆怅终乖吾党情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}